settings.list.prompt_replace:
Send the complete list for <code>{config_key}</code>. It will replace the current list.
{entry_hint}
Separate entries with spaces or newlines. /ignore to cancel. Timeout: 60 seconds.

settings.list.prompt_add:
Send entries to add to <code>{config_key}</code>. Existing entries will be kept and duplicates ignored.
{entry_hint}
Separate entries with spaces or newlines. /ignore to cancel. Timeout: 60 seconds.

settings.list.prompt_remove:
Send entries to remove from <code>{config_key}</code>. Other entries will be kept.
{entry_hint}
Separate entries with spaces or newlines. /ignore to cancel. Timeout: 60 seconds.
